# System Architecture

## 1. System Overview

The Smart Pesticide Sprayer is a prototype designed for automated crop monitoring and targeted spraying.

The system combines:

- Raspberry Pi-based image acquisition
- Camera-based crop monitoring
- Motorized cable-mounted movement
- Arduino-based motor control
- Arduino-controlled spraying
- Servo-based positioning
- Pump-based liquid delivery

